#+ Book 1 Scenario 3_07
#@{

#### 3_07 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_07_title"
	val[]: "Reversing to the Driver's Side"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_07_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll reverse through a long bend to better understand how to control the trailer."

#### 3_07 goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_inst1"
	val[]: "Reversing with a trailer"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_inst2"
	val[]: "How to rotate a trailer"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_inst3"
	val[]: "How to align a trailer"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_instruction"
	val[]: "Read the instructions"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_start"
	val[]: "Get your vehicle ready to drive"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_backward"
	val[]: "Set the vehicle in reverse"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_check1"
	val[]: "Bend the trailer"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_msg1"
	val[]: "Keep reversing"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_check2"
	val[]: "Complete the turn"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_stop"
	val[]: "Park in a marked spot"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_07_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_end@@"

#### 3_07 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene1"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll reverse into a turn on the driver's side. This side is easier because you have a better view and you're not fully dependent on mirrors. If you remember the basic principles, you should be able to easily master this after some practise."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene1b"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene1b_img@@<br>Remember, the trailer always turns <color value=@@clr_sel@@>opposite<color value=@@clr_txt@@> to how you initially steer the tractor."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene1c"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene1c_img@@<br>To get your trailer turning, steer the tractor<color value=@@clr_sel@@> opposite of the direction of the curve.<color value=@@clr_txt@@> <br>The trailer will turn<color value=@@clr_sel@@> into the direction of the curve.<color value=@@clr_txt@@>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene1d"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene1d_img@@<br>To hold the angle between the tractor and trailer, turn the tractor<br><color value=@@clr_sel@@>towards the trailer.<color value=@@clr_txt@@>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Check your surroundings, then begin reversing when you're ready."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Just before the beginning of the curve, steer the tractor slightly in the opposite direction of the curve to rotate the trailer in the direction of the turn."

	key[]:	"aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene4"
	val[]: "The trailer is angled in the direction of the curve. Steer the tractor towards the trailer to follow it into the curve."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Continue to hold the angle between the tractor and the trailer, make adjustments as necessary to keep the trailer going where you want it to."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Try not to make big steering inputs - small movements of the wheel can make a big difference in where the trailer will go."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene7"
	val[]: "Try to maintain the same angle for most of the turn so that you don't have to constantly work the trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene8"
	val[]: "As you exit the curve, get the tractor in front of the trailer to begin pushing the trailer straight towards the parking spot."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene9"
	val[]: "Align the trailer with the space.<br>Stop in the designated area."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_cutscene10"
	val[]: "Secure the truck and shut down the engine."

#### 3_07 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_start"
	val[]: "When reversing into a turn, it is necessary to be able to steer the trailer to the correct angle and maintain this angle throughout the entire turn, corrections should be made smoothly and gently.<br><br>To steer the trailer, turn the tractor against the direction of the curve.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Prepare the vehicle for reversing. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_backward"
	val[]: "Behind you, there is a curve angled to the driver's side.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start reversing and proceed to the turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_check1"
	val[]: "Steer very slightly in the opposite direction of the curve to get the trailer turned where you want it to go. Just a small input will get the trailer pointed where you want it.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Proceed to the turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_check2"
	val[]: "Continue into the turn, follow the trailer and try to keep a consistent angle between the tractor and trailer.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Keep reversing to the marked place. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_stop"
	val[]: "Complete the turn and align the  tractor with the trailer. You can pull forwards to correct yourself if necessary.<br><br>@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_07_end"
	val[]: "Nice driving!<br><br>@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"

#!}

#@}

#+ Book 1 Scenario 3_08
#@{
#!{

#### 3_08 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_08_title"
	val[]: "Reversing to the Blind Side"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_08_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll reverse through a long bend on the blind side. This is significantly more difficult because you can't see where you're going out of the window, and must rely on your mirrors."

#### 3_08 goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_08_msg0"
	val[]: "Turning to the Blind Side"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_08_start"
	val[]: "Getting your vehicle ready to drive"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_08_backward"
	val[]: "Preparing the vehicle for reversing"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_08_msg1"
	val[]: "Angling the trailer"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_08_msg2"
	val[]: "Aligning the truck into the turn"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_08_check1"
	val[]: "Passing the turn by reversing"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_08_stop"
	val[]: "Parking in the marked place"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_08_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_end@@"

#### 3_08 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_cutscene1"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll reverse into a turn on the blind side. This side is more challenging as the view from the driver's seat is impaired and mirrors must be used.<br><br>The principles for turning with the vehicle on the blind side are the same as for Turning on the driver's side."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Reverse the truck towards the curve."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Just before the beginning of the curve, steer the tractor slightly in the opposite direction of the curve to rotate the trailer in the direction of the turn."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_cutscene4"
	val[]: "The trailer is angled in the direction of the curve. Steer the tractor towards the trailer to follow it into the curve."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Try to maintain the same angle throughout the curve."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Get the tractor in front of the trailer and straighten out.<br>Park in the marked spot."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_cutscene7"
	val[]: "Secure the truck and shut down the engine."

#### 3_08 Driving Instructions

		key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_start"
	val[]: "When reversing into a turn, it is necessary to be able to steer the trailer to the correct angle and maintain this angle throughout the entire turn, corrections should be made smoothly and gently.<br><br>To steer the trailer, turn the tractor against the direction of the curve.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Prepare the vehicle for reversing. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_backward"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start reversing.<br><br><color value=@@clr_txt@@>Keep moving slowly straight back. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_msg1"
	val[]: "Steer very slightly towards the opposite direction of the curve. This will rotate the trailer into the curve, and then you can follow it around.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue into the curve. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_msg2"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Follow the trailer through the curve.<br><br><color value=@@clr_txt@@>Maintain the angle between the tractor and trailer. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_check1"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Make small steering inputs to maintain the angle.<color value=@@clr_txt@@><br><br>Continue towards the end of the curve. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_stop"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>As you approach your parking spot, get the tractor in front of the trailer and straighten out.<color value=@@clr_txt@@><br><br>Proceed to the designated area. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_08_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"

#!}
#@}

